From 1fd8359e893fb3c14217090fc0838676f37cdf77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:17:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): keep tool Apply and Add beside Close and use
 plain state lines

Keep the tool page footer fixed below its scroll area, show tool errors
above Close in the shape window, use plain English for Body tab state
lines, and align shape-window holder and Body rows label-left.

Fixes #2007
